        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric visual novel that forces you to face your demons — both literal and figurative. This narrative game is as personal (or spine tingling) as you choose. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The setting: A full moon. A notoriously supernatural forest. On the anniversary of your twin sister's mysterious death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tonight is your night to reach her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877760/extras/b88d3f449bbed1c966de79480ad7e2b2.poster.avif?t=1774057768\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877760/extras/b88d3f449bbed1c966de79480ad7e2b2.webm?t=1774057768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877760/extras/b88d3f449bbed1c966de79480ad7e2b2.mp4?t=1774057768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• About 1 hour of gameplay <br>• Seance complete with animated spirit board  <br>• Choose your path: Cozy horror <i>or</i> emotional resonance <br>• 100% Handmade Artwork  <br>• Atmospheric sound design <br>• Original soundtrack by Jeramy Parker</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877760/extras/a604cab2225d49fc6de4f72af468dd4a.poster.avif?t=1774057768\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877760/extras/a604cab2225d49fc6de4f72af468dd4a.webm?t=1774057768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati